# .roadmap.ghost mk1 — ghost subdomain SSOT (operator-only MVP, network-layer anonymity)
# Header on next line; entries follow as JSONL.
{"type":"header","kind":"subdomain","name":"ghost","glyph":"🕶️","mk":1,"perspective":"provider","origin_repo":"airgenome","parent":"airgenome.modules","goal":"network-layer anonymity (VPN/Tor/mixnet wrap) for orpheus 🗝️ research + wraith-wallet 🫥 broadcast — operator opsec only, customer-facing deferred to Phase 2","trio":["🗝️ orpheus (need-singularity/orpheus PRIVATE) — produces key","🫥 wraith-wallet (need-singularity/wraith-wallet PRIVATE) — custody+sign+route","🕶️ ghost (airgenome/modules/ghost) — network-layer hide"],"defaults":{"scope":"operator-only MVP","wrap_targets":["mullvad-cli","system-tor"],"phase2_wrap":["nym-sdk"],"tier_modes":{"research":"mullvad-multihop+daita","sweep":"tor-over-wireguard","broadcast_high_value":"nym-mixnet (Phase 2)"},"exit_jurisdictions":["JP","SG","CH","SE"],"forbidden":["KR Tor exit","VPN-over-Tor","cleartext traffic logging","customer-facing SaaS in MVP"],"business_model":"free / internal-only MVP","mk1_vpn_backend":"mullvad-cli","mk1_decision":{"date":"2026-05-04","mandate":"일단 Mullvad 마음에 들어서 mk1 을 이걸로 하자","alternatives_evaluated":"docs/ghost_backend_comparison_2026_05_04.ai.md","alternatives_deferred":["proton-vpn-secure-core (mk2 candidate — protocol-level G8 jurisdiction-pin enforcement)","ivpn-dynamic-multihop (mk2 candidate)"],"payment_route":"direct credit card on mullvad.net (KRW supported via Stripe; one-time top-up only since 2022-06 — no auto-renew); fallback Amazon US/UK voucher 또는 GiftCardFlix gift-card 리셀러 — see docs/ghost_backend_comparison_2026_05_04.ai.md §payment"}},"contracts":["G1 wrap_*.hexa single edit point","G2 no cleartext logging","G3 no deanonymizing telemetry","G4 kill-switch (cross-repo with wraith W4)","G5 separation-of-knowledge","G6 ai-native doc cadence","G7 no .py","G8 jurisdiction-explicit","G9 no tx broadcast in ghost","G10 live-mode honesty (downgrade recorded)"],"required_conditions":[{"id":"ghost.cond.0","desc":"research doc landed at airgenome/docs/ghost_feature_design_inbox_2026_05_04.ai.md; frontmatter status >= draft_inbox","verifier":"test -f docs/ghost_feature_design_inbox_2026_05_04.ai.md && grep -E '^status: draft_inbox|^status: draft|^status: ready' docs/ghost_feature_design_inbox_2026_05_04.ai.md","status":"met","evidence":["docs/ghost_feature_design_inbox_2026_05_04.ai.md (status: draft_inbox, origin: migrated_from_orpheus_docs_2026_05_04)","ghost-scrub bg agent migrated from orpheus/docs/sibling_ghost_design_2026_05_04.ai.md with frontmatter reframe"],"blocker_reason":""},{"id":"ghost.cond.1","desc":"skeleton landed: modules/ghost/{cpre/4 + module.ai.md + 7 stub .hexa + .roadmap.ghost} committed; main .roadmap.airgenome* gets subdomain pointer","verifier":"test -f modules/ghost/cpre/intent.ai.md && test -f modules/ghost/cpre/scope.ai.md && test -f modules/ghost/cpre/contracts.ai.md && test -f modules/ghost/cpre/identity.ai.md && test -f modules/ghost/module.ai.md && test -f modules/ghost/route.hexa && test -f modules/ghost/wrap_mullvad.hexa && test -f modules/ghost/wrap_tor.hexa && test -f modules/ghost/wrap_nym.hexa && test -f modules/ghost/policy.hexa && test -f modules/ghost/audit.hexa && test -f modules/ghost/selftest.hexa && test -f modules/ghost/.roadmap.ghost && grep -q 'subdomain.*ghost' .roadmap.airgenome_self_mk2_tuning","status":"met","evidence":["commit 4cdc9380 🕶️ feat(ghost): subdomain skeleton — cpre+moduler in modules/ghost/ (15 files, 1005 insertions, pushed to origin/main 2026-05-04)"],"blocker_reason":""},{"id":"ghost.cond.2","desc":"wrap_mullvad.hexa — Mullvad CLI W1-style single edit point (mk1 sole VPN backend, locked 2026-05-04). connect / disconnect / health(G3-label-only) / relay-set / multihop / daita / lockdown 캡슐화. G1 enforced via grep test (no `mullvad` reference outside this file). Phase-1 single-backend posture — Proton/IVPN deferred to mk2 (see docs/ghost_backend_comparison_2026_05_04.ai.md). Verified against mullvad-cli 2026.2 (Tahoe-26 host).","verifier":"(hexa run modules/ghost/wrap_mullvad.hexa self-test 2>&1 | grep -qE '__GHOST_WRAP_MULLVAD__ (PASS|SKIP)') && ! (grep -rn 'exec.*mullvad\\|\"mullvad\"' modules/ghost/ --include='*.hexa' | grep -v 'wrap_mullvad.hexa')","status":"met","evidence":["wrap_mullvad.hexa lands with: _mv_exec G1 chokepoint, mullvad_health (G3 label-only — awk first-token strips IPv4/visible-location G2 leaks), connect/disconnect/reconnect, relay_set_location, multihop_set, daita_set, lockdown_set, selftest sentinel __GHOST_WRAP_MULLVAD__ <PASS|FAIL|SKIP>","selftest under docker sandbox: SKIP (mullvad CLI absent in hexa-runner image — graceful fail-closed)","G1 invariant verified: `grep -rn 'exec.*mullvad|\"mullvad\"' modules/ghost/ --include='*.hexa' | grep -v 'wrap_mullvad.hexa'` returns empty (only wrap_mullvad.hexa:34 `MULLVAD_BIN = \"mullvad\"` matches outside the filter)","host-mode live PASS verification: operator-step (run on host shell with mullvad-cli 2026.2 on PATH) — selftest emits PASS when daemon reachable + relay list non-empty"],"blocker_reason":""},{"id":"ghost.cond.3","desc":"wrap_tor.hexa — system Tor wrap with control port (9051) + circuit isolation (NEWNYM signal). KR exit excluded via tor ExitNodes config. G1 enforced.","verifier":"hexa run modules/ghost/wrap_tor.hexa --selftest 2>&1 | grep -q '__GHOST_WRAP_TOR__ PASS' && curl --socks5-hostname 127.0.0.1:9050 -s https://check.torproject.org/api/ip | grep -q 'IsTor.*true'","status":"unmet","evidence":[],"blocker_reason":""},{"id":"ghost.cond.4","desc":"route.hexa — tier policy router + airgenome layer entry surface. mk1 minimal: ghost_up/down/health/tunnel_alive 공개 함수 + main() CLI dispatch. Full lifecycle FSM (down→connecting→up→degrading→killed) + audit downgrade record (G10) deferred to cond.7 closure. tier ∈ {research, sweep, broadcast_high_value, customer} → mk1 = Mullvad fall-back (research config) for all tiers since cond.3/cond.10 unmet. bin/airgenome 의 cmd_ghost (ghost subcmd dispatch) 가 layer entry. wrap_mullvad subprocess 호출 via exec — hexa stage1 import-as-alias void bug 우회 (orpheus blk.3 와 동일 패턴).","verifier":"(hexa run modules/ghost/route.hexa self-test 2>&1 | grep -qE '__GHOST_ROUTE__ (PASS|SKIP)') && bin/airgenome ghost help 2>&1 | grep -q 'tunnel-alive' && grep -q 'cmd_ghost' bin/airgenome","status":"met","evidence":["route.hexa: ghost_up(tier)/ghost_down()/ghost_health()/ghost_tunnel_alive()/selftest() + main() CLI parser (up [tier] | down | status | health | tunnel-alive | self-test)","wrap_mullvad.hexa main() extended: connect/disconnect/reconnect/relay-set/multihop-set/daita-set/lockdown-set subcommands","bin/airgenome cmd_ghost: layer entry shell — `airgenome ghost {up [tier] | down | status | tunnel-alive | selftest | available}` with $hexa_bin / $ag_root resolution (HEXA env or PATH; AIRGENOME_ROOT or script-derived)","help text in bin/airgenome `airgenome help` 에 ghost 항목 추가","verified end-to-end: airgenome ghost status → 'down' (hexa run via route.hexa → exec subprocess wrap_mullvad health → label 'down' since CLI absent in docker sandbox); airgenome ghost tunnel-alive → exit 1 (correct fail-closed for wraith W4 cross-repo gate); selftest emits __GHOST_ROUTE__ SKIP + __GHOST_WRAP_MULLVAD__ SKIP (graceful)","module.ai.md updated with airgenome layer entry surface table + tier↔backend mapping + cross-repo gate example"],"blocker_reason":""},{"id":"ghost.cond.5","desc":"policy.hexa — exit-jurisdiction allowlist (JP/SG/CH/SE for sweep tiers) + KR Tor exit hard-deny + G5 knowledge guard (caller payload classification) + G10 downgrade decision matrix.","verifier":"hexa run modules/ghost/policy.hexa --selftest 2>&1 | grep -q '__GHOST_POLICY__ PASS' && hexa run modules/ghost/policy.hexa --check-exit=KR --tier=sweep | grep -q 'reject' && hexa run modules/ghost/policy.hexa --check-exit=JP --tier=sweep | grep -q 'allow'","status":"unmet","evidence":[],"blocker_reason":""},{"id":"ghost.cond.6","desc":"kill-switch — ghost::tunnel_alive() cross-repo gate. wraith-wallet's W4 broadcast policy gate MUST call ghost::tunnel_alive() before any broadcast; ghost down ⇒ broadcast deny. kernel-level pf/NE enforcement is cond.9 opt-in, userland cooperative gate is here.","verifier":"hexa run modules/ghost/route.hexa --tunnel-down && hexa run ${WRAITH_ROOT:-../wraith-wallet}/modules/policy/route.hexa --broadcast-attempt --route='public_mempool' 2>&1 | grep -q 'denied:.*ghost.tunnel_down' && grep -rn 'ghost::tunnel_alive' ${WRAITH_ROOT:-../wraith-wallet}/modules/ | head -1","status":"unmet","evidence":[],"blocker_reason":"requires wraith-wallet side adapter — cross-repo cond, lands paired with wraith.cond.<W4-extension>"},{"id":"ghost.cond.7","desc":"audit.hexa — metadata-only JSONL emit (G2 + G8). schema {ts, requester, tier, backend, exit_jurisdiction, rationale, health, no_content:true}. cleartext payload absence enforced via field whitelist. downgrade events recorded as record_kind=downgrade (G10).","verifier":"hexa run modules/ghost/audit.hexa --selftest 2>&1 | grep -q '__GHOST_AUDIT__ PASS' && tail -1 state/ghost_audit.jsonl | jq -e '.no_content == true and .exit_jurisdiction != null and .rationale != null'","status":"unmet","evidence":[],"blocker_reason":""},{"id":"ghost.cond.8","desc":"selftest.hexa — DNS / IPv6 / WebRTC / SNI fingerprint pre-flight. broadcast tier 직전 호출, FAIL 시 wraith broadcast 거부. all probes via wrap_*.hexa (G1).","verifier":"hexa run modules/ghost/selftest.hexa --run-all 2>&1 | grep -q '__GHOST_SELFTEST__ PASS all' && state/leak_reports/<ts>.jsonl exists","status":"unmet","evidence":[],"blocker_reason":""},{"id":"ghost.cond.9","desc":"capability flag — kernel-level pf (macOS) / nftables / NetworkExtension opt-in. user-explicit consent required (settings panel checkbox + audit log). without flag: userland cooperative gate only. with flag: pf rules block all egress except localhost + tunnel reconnect target on tunnel-down.","verifier":"hexa run modules/ghost/policy.hexa --kernel-kill-switch=on --selftest 2>&1 | grep -q 'pf_enabled.*true' && pfctl -sr | grep -q 'ghost.kill_switch' && airgenome ghost capability-status | grep -q 'kernel_kill_switch.*enabled'","status":"unmet","evidence":[],"blocker_reason":"macOS pf integration requires elevated privilege — design must keep operator opt-in path explicit; surface in settings panel TBD"},{"id":"ghost.cond.10","desc":"wrap_nym.hexa Phase-2 — Nym SDK wrap real impl (Rust SDK via FFI bridge or nymcli subprocess). 5-hop NGM mode for broadcast_high_value tier (#135-class sweep ≥10 BTC). G10 — Nym down ⇒ explicit downgrade audit + caller degraded.","verifier":"hexa run modules/ghost/wrap_nym.hexa --selftest 2>&1 | grep -q '__GHOST_WRAP_NYM__ PASS' && hexa run modules/ghost/route.hexa --up --tier=broadcast_high_value --backend=nym | grep -q 'nym_mixnet.*up'","status":"unmet","evidence":[],"blocker_reason":"Phase 2 — depends on cond.6/7/8 closure + user decision on FFI vs subprocess bridge"},{"id":"ghost.cond.11","desc":"integration — orpheus + wraith-wallet hook points. (a) orpheus 외부 HTTP 호출이 modules/link/ghost.hexa 경유로 ghost::route(tier=research) 통과; (b) wraith-wallet broadcast/swap 호출이 modules/link/ghost.hexa 경유로 ghost::route(tier=sweep) 통과 + G4 tunnel_alive() gate 통과.","verifier":"(a) test -f ${ORPHEUS_ROOT:-../orpheus}/modules/link/ghost.hexa && grep -q 'ghost::route' ${ORPHEUS_ROOT:-../orpheus}/modules/link/ghost.hexa && hexa run ${ORPHEUS_ROOT:-../orpheus}/modules/link/ghost.hexa --selftest 2>&1 | grep -q '__ORPHEUS_LINK_GHOST__ PASS' && (b) test -f ${WRAITH_ROOT:-../wraith-wallet}/modules/link/ghost.hexa && grep -q 'ghost::route' ${WRAITH_ROOT:-../wraith-wallet}/modules/link/ghost.hexa && hexa run ${WRAITH_ROOT:-../wraith-wallet}/modules/link/ghost.hexa --selftest 2>&1 | grep -q '__WRAITH_LINK_GHOST__ PASS'","status":"unmet","evidence":[],"blocker_reason":"cross-repo cond — orpheus + wraith adapter files land in their respective repos paired with ghost.cond.4/6/7"}],"blockers":[{"id":"ghost.blk.1","desc":"design research doc move from orpheus/docs/sibling_ghost_design_2026_05_04.ai.md → airgenome/docs/ghost_feature_design_inbox_2026_05_04.ai.md (frontmatter reframe sibling_design_research → airgenome.modules.ghost.feature_design)","status":"resolved","resolved_2026_05_04":"ghost-scrub bg agent completed move; doc frontmatter reframed to airgenome.docs.ghost_feature_design_inbox / kind: feature_design_inbox / status: draft_inbox; cond.0 verifier passes"},{"id":"ghost.blk.2","desc":"customer-facing scope (Phase 2) crosses KR ISMS + PIPA + likely VASP-adjacent posture if crypto-paid; deferred from MVP","status":"acknowledged","mitigation":"out-of-MVP per scope.ai.md hard line; revisit at cond.10/11 closure with explicit jurisdictional review doc"},{"id":"ghost.blk.3","desc":"Phase-2 Nym SDK integration — FFI bridge (hexa-FFI immature) vs subprocess (nymcli) decision pending","status":"acknowledged","mitigation":"wrap_nym.hexa is permanent stub until cond.10 lands; route.hexa fall-back to sweep tier with G10 audit downgrade record"}],"status":"active","since":"2026-05-04"}
